[0,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[HGITGOOD / WEB TOUR / SAMPLE DATA\r\n========================================================================================\r\n[1/5] Sign in to a private installation\r\nScreen: /\r\nSign in -> Repositories -> Code -> Review -> Releases\r\n\r\nA GOOD PLACE FOR YOUR CODE\r\nBuild something good.\r\nCode, collaboration, and a clear path from change to delivery.\r\nSign in to your installation\r\nUsername\r\nPassword\r\n\r\nActual frontend; synthetic API responses. This is not a terminal recording."]
[2.4,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[HGITGOOD / WEB TOUR / SAMPLE DATA\r\n========================================================================================\r\n[2/5] Find your team repository\r\nScreen: /\r\nSign in -> Repositories -> Code -> Review -> Releases\r\n\r\nA GOOD PLACE FOR YOUR CODE\r\nYour repositories\r\nPrivate by default. Owned by your team.\r\ndemo / fieldnotes\r\nReady for your first commit.\r\nClone URL\r\nSSH clone URL\r\ndemo / design-system\r\nReady for your first commit.\r\nClone URL\r\nSSH clone URL\r\ndemo / handbook\r\nReady for your first commit.\r\nClone URL\r\nSSH clone URL\r\nCreate a repository\r\nTeam\r\n\r\nActual frontend; synthetic API responses. This is not a terminal recording."]
[4.8,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[HGITGOOD / WEB TOUR / SAMPLE DATA\r\n========================================================================================\r\n[3/5] Browse code at a pinned commit\r\nScreen: /repos/demo/fieldnotes\r\nSign in -> Repositories -> Code -> Review -> Releases\r\n\r\nPRIVATE REPOSITORY\r\ndemo / fieldnotes\r\nClone URL\r\nBranch\r\nmain\r\nclear-release-notes\r\nThis view stays on its commit when a branch advances. Choose a branch to view its\r\ncurrent tip.\r\nDirectory\r\ndocs\r\nDirectory\r\nsrc\r\nFile\r\nREADME.md\r\nFile\r\npackage.json\r\nCommit history\r\n\r\nActual frontend; synthetic API responses. This is not a terminal recording."]
[7.199999999999999,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[HGITGOOD / WEB TOUR / SAMPLE DATA\r\n========================================================================================\r\n[4/5] Read a pull request and its diff\r\nScreen: /repos/demo/fieldnotes/pulls/17d5ec13-64cd-49a0-a706-6b0ff7b88fc1\r\nSign in -> Repositories -> Code -> Review -> Releases\r\n\r\nPULL REQUEST OPEN\r\nMake release notes easier to scan\r\nclear-release-notes main fast-forward\r\nGroup release notes by the kind of change and connect each item to its review. The\r\nchecklist keeps the last step clear for everyone on the team.\r\nSource e419d4052fa8 target 8e605066c6fb policy 3\r\nChanges\r\ndiff --git a/docs/release-checklist.md b/docs/release-checklist.md\r\nindex 31bd73a..b512a06 100644\r\n--- a/docs/release-checklist.md\r\n+++ b/docs/release-checklist.md\r\n@@ -1,4 +1,8 @@\r\n # Release checklist\r\n\r\n-Prepare the release notes.\r\n+## Before publishing\r\n+\r\n\r\nActual frontend; synthetic API responses. This is not a terminal recording."]
[9.6,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[HGITGOOD / WEB TOUR / SAMPLE DATA\r\n========================================================================================\r\n[5/5] Inspect a sample release and its assets\r\nScreen: /repos/demo/fieldnotes\r\nSign in -> Repositories -> Code -> Review -> Releases\r\n\r\nReleases\r\nPublished releases identify an existing Git tag, its commit and checksummed assets. A\r\ndraft is work in progress.\r\nFieldnotes v0.3.0 demo\r\nv0.3.0-demo published 2026-10-11T09:20:00Z\r\nFieldnotes v0.3.0 demo\r\nRelease published\r\nTag v0.3.0-demo commit 8e605066c6fbc463f207be551303e6a2610b4093\r\nTag object dfdaaf433cae4477f97c53983025f8ee35573b85 Changes since\r\n1d393ae92c1b684aa8b594599a6e130836604d20\r\nA clearer daily workflow for the Fieldnotes sample team.\r\nAdded\r\n- A short checklist for preparing each release.\r\n- Links between release notes and reviewed changes.\r\nChanged\r\n- Product notes now live together under docs/.\r\nSynthetic sample release for the interface tour; not a Gitgood product release.\r\n\r\nActual frontend; synthetic API responses. This is not a terminal recording."]
[12,"o","\r\nEnd of screen tour.\r\n"]
